g/content/article/living-world/2026/epigenetic-effects-of-sperm-on-offspring&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=Knowable%20Magazine&amp;type=rss&amp;context=too_gloomy%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Paternal%20Epigenetic%20Inheritance%3A%20RNA%27s%20Role%20in%20Offspring%20Traits&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:https://knowablemagazine.org/content/article/living-world/2026/epigenetic-effects-of-sperm-on-offspring</guid><enclosure url="https://knowablemagazine.org/docserver/fulltext/small-sperm-rnas-500x288.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 08:56:39 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Research) Childhood: The Lasting Impact of Parent-Child Power Dynamics</title><link>https://aeon.co/essays/the-power-imbalance-between-parent-and-child-leaves-a-trace</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; Aeon | a world of ideas&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This essay explores the enduring impact of the inherent power imbalance between parents and children. It argues that the asymmetry of power during childhood leaves a lasting trace on individuals, influencing their later lives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//aeon.co/essays/the-power-imbalance-between-parent-and-child-leaves-a-trace&amp;signal=3&amp;source=Aeon%20%7C%20a%20world%20of%20ideas&amp;type=rss&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Childhood%3A%20The%20Lasting%20Impact%20of%20Parent-Child%20Power%20Dynamics&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='ht